y optimistic heroes, but expands the \u2018swipe\u2019 mechanic into a dynamic grid based system. This means more depth and longevity \u2013 our heroes will have to choose perks to complement their deck-building strategy and carefully manage the board if they wish to triumph.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/meteorfall-krumits-tale", "videos": [{"id": 28412, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "baCJBZsYEYE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=baCJBZsYEYE", "title": "Meteorfall: Krumit's Tale", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/baCJBZsYEYE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 166221, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "LVYy5fLCquA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LVYy5fLCquA", "title": "Meteorfall: Krumit\u2019s Tale - Console Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LVYy5fLCquA/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 5703, "name": "Meteorfall"}]}